<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Upload Questions - AI Study Generator</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --royal-purple: #7C3AED;
            --royal-blue: #2563EB;
            --royal-gold: #F59E0B;
            --dark-bg: #0F172A;
            --dark-card: #1E293B;
            --dark-border: #334155;
            --text-primary: #F8FAFC;
            --text-secondary: #CBD5E1;
            --text-muted: #94A3B8;
        }
        body {
            background: var(--dark-bg);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .page-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #312E81 0%, #7C3AED 100%);
            padding: 2rem 0;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--royal-gold);
        }
        .page-header h1 { color: var(--royal-gold); font-weight: 700; }
        .card-section {
            background: var(--dark-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .section-label {
            color: var(--royal-gold);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }
        .form-control {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
            border: 2px solid var(--dark-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .form-control:focus {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
            border-color: var(--royal-gold);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.25rem rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25);
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }
        .btn-upload {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--royal-purple) 0%, var(--royal-blue) 100%);
            border: 2px solid var(--royal-gold);
            color: white;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn-upload:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #3B82F6 100%);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.4);
            color: white;
        }
        .alert-danger {
            background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.4);
            color: #FCA5A5;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        .alert-success {
            background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4);
            color: #86EFAC;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        .summary-stat {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0.6rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
        }
        .summary-stat:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .summary-stat .label { color: var(--text-secondary); }
        .summary-stat .value { font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .stat-green { color: #86EFAC; }
        .stat-red { color: #FCA5A5; }
        .stat-default { color: var(--text-primary); }
        .error-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: separate;
            border-spacing: 0;
        }
        .error-table th {
            background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.15);
            color: var(--royal-gold);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        }
        .error-table th:first-child { border-radius: 10px 0 0 0; }
        .error-table th:last-child { border-radius: 0 10px 0 0; }
        .error-table td {
            padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .error-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
        .csv-example {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid var(--dark-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1rem;
            overflow-x: auto;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            white-space: pre;
        }
        .file-input-wrapper {
            position: relative;
        }
        .file-input-wrapper input[type="file"]::file-selector-button {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--royal-purple) 0%, var(--royal-blue) 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--royal-gold);
            color: white;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-right: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .file-input-wrapper input[type="file"]::file-selector-button:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #3B82F6 100%);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page-header">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                <h1><i class="bi bi-cloud-upload me-2"></i>Upload Questions</h1>
                <a href="/institute/dashboard" class="btn btn-outline-light"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i> Dashboard</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container py-4">
        <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
            <div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">
                <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle me-2"></i><%= error %>
            </div>
        <% } %>
        <% if (typeof success !== 'undefined' && success) { %>
            <div class="alert alert-success" role="alert">
                <i class="bi bi-check-circle me-2"></i><%= success %>
            </div>
        <% } %>

        <% if (typeof summary !== 'undefined' && summary) { %>
            <!-- Upload Summary Results -->
            <div class="card-section">
                <div class="section-label">Upload Results</div>
                <div class="summary-stat">
                    <span class="label"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark me-2"></i>Filename</span>
                    <span class="value stat-default"><%= summary.filename %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-stat">
                    <span class="label"><i class="bi bi-list-ol me-2"></i>Total Rows</span>
                    <span class="value stat-default"><%= summary.totalRows %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-stat">
                    <span class="label"><i class="bi bi-check-circle me-2"></i>Successful Inserts</span>
                    <span class="value stat-green"><%= summary.processedRows %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-stat">
                    <span class="label"><i class="bi bi-x-circle me-2"></i>Failed Rows</span>
                    <span class="value stat-red"><%= summary.failedRows %></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <% if (summary.errors && summary.errors.length > 0) { %>
                <div class="card-section">
                    <div class="section-label">Error Details</div>
                    <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
                        <table class="error-table">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Row</th>
                                    <th>Errors</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <% summary.errors.forEach(function(err) { %>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong><%= err.row %></strong></td>
                                        <td>
                                            <% if (Array.isArray(err.errors)) { %>
                                                <% err.errors.forEach(function(e) { %>
                                                    <div><i class="bi bi-dot"></i> <%= e %></div>
                                                <% }); %>
                                            <% } else { %>
                                                <%= err.errors %>
                                            <% } %>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                <% }); %>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            <% } %>
        <% } %>

        <!-- Upload Form -->
        <div class="card-section">
            <div class="section-label">Upload File</div>
            <form method="POST" action="/institute/questions/upload" enctype="multipart/form-data">
                <div class="file-input-wrapper mb-3">
                    <input type="file" class="form-control" name="file" accept=".csv,.xlsx" required>
                </div>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                    Accepted formats: <strong>.csv</strong> and <strong>.xlsx</strong> — Max file size: 10 MB
                </p>
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-upload">
                    <i class="bi bi-cloud-upload me-2"></i>Upload Questions
                </button>
            </form>
        </div>

        <!-- CSV Format Example -->
        <div class="card-section">
            <div class="section-label">Expected CSV Format</div>
            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                Your file should contain the following columns. Fields marked with <span style="color: #FCA5A5;">*</span> are required.
            </p>
            <div class="csv-example">question_text*,option1*,option2*,option3*,option4*,correct_answer*,solution,difficulty_tier,topic_hint
"A ball is thrown at 45°...",v²sin2θ/g,v²/g,2v²/g,v²sin²θ/2g,1,"Use projectile range formula",3,projectile_motion</div>
            <div class="mt-3" style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
                <strong style="color: var(--text-secondary);">Column reference:</strong>
                <ul class="mt-1 mb-0" style="padding-left: 1.25rem;">
                    <li><code>question_text</code> <span style="color: #FCA5A5;">*</span> — The question prompt</li>
                    <li><code>option1</code> – <code>option4</code> <span style="color: #FCA5A5;">*</span> — Four answer choices</li>
                    <li><code>correct_answer</code> <span style="color: #FCA5A5;">*</span> — Correct option number (1–4)</li>
                    <li><code>solution</code> — Solution explanation (optional)</li>
                    <li><code>difficulty_tier</code> — 1 (easy), 2 (medium), 3 (hard) — defaults to 2</li>
                    <li><code>topic_hint</code> — Hint for AI concept tagging (optional)</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
